---
/**
 * Merge and check: findings of one file into buckets by place (`mergeFindings`), then checks in rounds
 * (`checkRounds`), each bucket's best finding first and a bucket's next only while no check confirmed it, and each
 * verdict's outcome after its quote is checked against the head's file (`quoteWithin`).
 */
import Figure from "./Figure.astro"

const findings = [
  { id: "turn 1 · #1", line: 40, y: 70, bucket: "A" },
  { id: "turn 2 · #1", line: 42, y: 100, bucket: "A" },
  { id: "turn 1 · #2", line: 43, y: 130, bucket: "B" },
  { id: "turn 2 · #2", line: 96, y: 200, bucket: "C" },
] as const
---

<Figure label="Merging findings and checking them" minWidth={780}>
  <svg class="rv-svg" viewBox="0 0 940 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="mc-t">
    <title id="mc-t">Findings near each other from different turns share a bucket; checks run in rounds; a confirmed verdict counts only when its quote is in the file</title>
    <defs>
      <marker id="mc-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path class="head" d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z"></path></marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="10" y="22" class="t-b t-sm">Findings in src/store.ts</text>
    <text x="10" y="40" class="t-xs t-dim">line · turn · number in that turn</text>
    {
      findings.map((f) => (
        <g>
          <rect class={f.bucket === "C" ? "box" : "box-2"} x="10" y={f.y - 16} width="190" height="26" rx="6" stroke-dasharray={f.bucket === "C" ? "4 4" : undefined}></rect>
          <text x="22" y={f.y + 2} class="t-mono t-xs">{`line ${f.line}`}</text>
          <text x="90" y={f.y + 2} class="t-xs t-dim">{f.id}</text>
        </g>
      ))
    }
    <text x="10" y="240" class="t-xs t-dim">more than two lines from any changed line:</text>
    <text x="10" y="256" class="t-xs t-dim">bucketed apart, off the changed lines</text>

    <path class="line" d="M200 70 H262" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M200 100 C232 100 232 80 262 80" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M200 130 H262" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M200 200 H262" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>

    <rect class="box" x="266" y="52" width="230" height="44" rx="8"></rect>
    <text x="278" y="70" class="t-sm t-b">bucket A</text>
    <text x="278" y="86" class="t-xs t-dim">anchored at line 40; two votes</text>
    <rect class="box" x="266" y="112" width="230" height="44" rx="8"></rect>
    <text x="278" y="130" class="t-sm t-b">bucket B</text>
    <text x="278" y="146" class="t-xs t-dim">turn 1 already in A: never twice</text>
    <rect class="box" x="266" y="180" width="230" height="44" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></rect>
    <text x="278" y="198" class="t-sm t-b">bucket C</text>
    <text x="278" y="214" class="t-xs t-dim">kept apart: off the changed lines</text>

    <path class="line" d="M496 74 H540" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M496 134 H540" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>

    <rect class="model" x="544" y="38" width="190" height="118" rx="10"></rect>
    <text x="556" y="60" class="t-sm t-b">round 1</text>
    <text x="556" y="80" class="t-xs t-dim">each kept bucket's best</text>
    <text x="556" y="96" class="t-xs t-dim">finding: the most severe,</text>
    <text x="556" y="112" class="t-xs t-dim">then the longest evidence</text>
    <text x="556" y="134" class="t-xs t-dim">round 2, 3: a bucket's next,</text>
    <text x="556" y="150" class="t-xs t-dim">only while none confirmed it</text>

    <path class="line" d="M734 96 H770" marker-end="url(#mc-a)"></path>
    {
      [
        ["confirmed", "and its quote holds: reported", "core"],
        ["unsure", "or confirmed, quote not found", "box-2"],
        ["refuted", "not reported", "box"],
        ["unchecked", "no verdict: listed, with why", "box"],
      ].map(([name, why, cls], i) => (
        <g>
          <rect class={cls} x="774" y={20 + i * 52} width="160" height="44" rx="8"></rect>
          <text x="786" y={38 + i * 52} class="t-sm t-b">{name}</text>
          <text x="786" y={55 + i * 52} class="t-xs t-dim">{why}</text>
        </g>
      ))
    }
    <text x="544" y="190" class="t-xs t-dim">each check: a turn of stage Verify</text>
    <text x="544" y="206" class="t-xs t-dim">on the same prefix, asked to refute</text>
    <text x="544" y="222" class="t-xs t-dim">first, ending once its verdict is</text>
    <text x="544" y="238" class="t-xs t-dim">recorded; up to three a bucket</text>
    <text x="10" y="290" class="t-xs t-faint">The paths, lines and turns are an example drawn for this page.</text>
  </svg>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <strong>Merge is code; a check is a model's turn.</strong> A finding joins the first bucket whose first finding it
    starts within three lines of and that holds nothing of its own turn, so buckets never chain and one turn never
    votes twice. By default every bucket on the changed lines is kept and checked; <code>--vote</code> (whole focus only) keeps a bucket
    only with two votes or a security finding.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
